{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果與Epic Games圍繞App Store應用商店政策展開的法律爭端再次出現新進展。當地時間11月13日，Epic向美國最高法院提交了最新法律文件，要求法院繼續追究蘋果的責任，認為蘋果雖然在形式上遵守了此前法院作出的裁決，但實際上通過收費政策和其他限制措施，規避了判決希望實現的目標。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586322.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T21:28:11.430629+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T21:01:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T21:21:25.351749+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T21:21:25.351749+00:00","content_hash":"8b0441e72029babd67a54974491d0db2fd264e2766a7f7600b5522b6539b6cff","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}